/T (Our Final Placement season for the 2022-2024 batch has been another resounding success, with significant achievements despite the challenging market conditions. We managed to secure placements for everyone enrolled through the placement committee. This year, we achieved a year-on-year growth of 13.5% in median CTC, maintaining the highest CTC and average CTC, which underscores the strong industry relations of our department. The total number of recruiters increased from 11 to 21, coming from diverse domains such as Ecommerce, BFSI, Manufacturing & FMCG giants, Consulting, and Analytics.)
/E (Our Final Placement season for the 2022-2024 batch has been another resounding success, with significant achievements despite the challenging market conditions. We managed to secure placements for everyone enrolled through the placement committee. This year, we achieved a year-on-year growth of 13.5% in median CTC, maintaining the highest CTC and average CTC, which underscores the strong industry relations of our department. The total number of recruiters increased from 11 to 21, coming from diverse domains such as Ecommerce, BFSI, Manufacturing & FMCG giants, Consulting, and Analytics.)
