770 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/T (The final placement process at the Department of Management Studies \(DoMS\), IIT Kanpur, witnessed remarkable achievements this year. A total of 21 companies actively recruited from our campus, offering a diverse array of job profiles. This represents a 0.9x increase compared to the previous year, highlighting the growing interest of recruiters in our talent pool. The rigorous curriculum, coupled with practical exposure, continues to attract industry attention who were impressed by the exceptional quality of our program and the remarkable skill set possessed by our students. Reflecting recent industry trends and aligning with the evolving business landscape, a significant portion of recruiters specialized in Analytics, Finance and Marketing. IT companies extended several offers, providing additional avenues for our students. The tech sector remains a vital contributor to our placement success which exemplifies the techno-managerial approach of the department.)
/E (The final placement process at the Department of Management Studies \(DoMS\), IIT Kanpur, witnessed remarkable achievements this year. A total of 21 companies actively recruited from our campus, offering a diverse array of job profiles. This represents a 0.9x increase compared to the previous year, highlighting the growing interest of recruiters in our talent pool. The rigorous curriculum, coupled with practical exposure, continues to attract industry attention who were impressed by the exceptional quality of our program and the remarkable skill set possessed by our students. Reflecting recent industry trends and aligning with the evolving business landscape, a significant portion of recruiters specialized in Analytics, Finance and Marketing. IT companies extended several offers, providing additional avenues for our students. The tech sector remains a vital contributor to our placement success which exemplifies the techno-managerial approach of the department.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [10]
>>
