/T (The Prabandhan Committee members are the driving force behind the success of DoMS IIT Kanpur's annual management festival. Comprising dedicated and passionate students, this team meticulously plans and executes various events that provide a dynamic platform for participants to showcase and enhance their management skills.  Their unwavering commitment and innovative approach ensure that each edition of Prabandhan is better than the last, offering unique experiences and opportunities for learning and growth. The committee's efforts highlight their organizational prowess and foster a vibrant community spirit, making Prabandhan a hallmark event of our institute.)
