/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (Prabandhan is the annual management festival of DoMS IIT Kanpur. It is designed to provide students with a dynamic platform to showcase and enhance their management skills through unique events. Beyond traditional National-level case competitions, our festival features guest lectures, seminars, and CXO-level panel discussions with industry leaders sharing insights on current topics. With its multifaceted approach, Prabandhan empowers students to not only showcase their talents but also to engage with the latest developments in the world of management.)
/E (Prabandhan is the annual management festival of DoMS IIT Kanpur. It is designed to provide students with a dynamic platform to showcase and enhance their management skills through unique events. Beyond traditional National-level case competitions, our festival features guest lectures, seminars, and CXO-level panel discussions with industry leaders sharing insights on current topics. With its multifaceted approach, Prabandhan empowers students to not only showcase their talents but also to engage with the latest developments in the world of management.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [19]
