<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (REFLEXIONS, part of Prabandhan, is an event that brings together CXOs and founders from various industries to exchange insights, experiences, and innovative ideas. It provides a dynamic platform for engaging dialogue and explorative thinking, fostering diverse perspectives. The event aims to prepare future industry leaders through thought-provoking discussions on pivotal business areas. REFLEXIONS encourages participants to delve into critical business issues, share best practices, and collaborate on solutions, driving growth and innovation across sectors. By facilitating meaningful conversations, REFLEXIONS plays a crucial role in shaping the future of business leadership among MBA students.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
965 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (VOX POPULI, part of the annual Management Conclave Prabandhan'24, is a comprehensive platform covering four key management domains: Marketing, Finance, Analytics, and Human Resources. It unites industry leaders to share insights and experiences, offering invaluable perspectives on the evolving corporate landscape. This event provides a unique opportunity for attendees to engage with experts, gain knowledge on current trends, and understand the challenges and opportunities in these critical areas. By fostering an environment of learning and networking, VOX POPULI equips participants with the tools and insights needed to navigate and succeed in the dynamic business world.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
